Package: com.ratush.jetsamfix
Name: JetsamFix
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Memory-manager daemon for Dopamine rootless. Removes SpringBoard's per-process jetsam fatal cap, raises backboardd/VPN priority, and enables global aggressive-lenient mode to reduce OOM/safe-mode crashes on iOS 17. Control via `jetsamfix status|apply|lenient on|off`.
Maintainer: ratush
Author: ratush
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
